<div id="u-credit-00205-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eilsyria-0081" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6370172); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6370172&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607522603" alt="Eilsyria-0081" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6370172)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eilsyria-0081" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6370172); return false;">Eilsyria-0081</a></span></p>
